    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113978" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῖδρον</span></b> , τό, mostly in
		pl. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῖδρα</span></b> , τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unripe
				wheaten-groats,</i> rubbed from the ear in the hands, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				806
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				595
			</span></i> (troch.) (cf. Sch. ad locc., <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				129.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				1.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.1
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέα πεφρυγμένα χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					2.14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				23.14
			</span></i>: sg., <i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				75
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χίδρα</span></b> , ἡ, is corrupt in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέδρα</span></b>  is
				v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.180
			</span></i>.</div>
